          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The origin of పెరడు (peraḍu) is uncertain. DEDR has no entry for it; the nearest is peḍalu, \"backyard\", which DEDR 4146 lists under peḍa, \"back\". DEDR 4205 also has Kannada peṟagu, \"backside\", and pittil, \"backyard\"."
            }
          ]
